WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,940 --> 00:00:03,460
Do you want to buy pancakes? Wait a few minutes before they come out of the oven.

2
00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:06,660
Mom, I'm back

3
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:09,480
You came back so soon

4
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:10,480
Miss you

5
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:13,740
Come on, don't you have any money?

6
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:14,900
Save some flowers every day

7
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:16,340
Your clothes don't look cheap at first glance

8
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:17,980
Stay away and don't get your clothes dirty.

9
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:19,780
Mom, take a good look

10
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:22,460
Your son is now the boss of the company and has no shortage of money.

11
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:26,330
Xiaodian, these two are aunties. Hello.

12
00:00:26,330 --> 00:00:27,730
We are Mr. Li's assistant

13
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:31,200
Xiaodian, what is the name of your company and what does it do?

14
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:32,240
Go check it out online

15
00:00:33,130 --> 00:00:34,690
Mom, I can't tell you

16
00:00:34,690 --> 00:00:36,930
Xiaodian, tell the truth to mom

17
00:00:36,930 --> 00:00:39,690
Are you doing anything illegal or illegal? Let me tell you.

18
00:00:39,690 --> 00:00:40,890
What, Mom?

19
00:00:40,890 --> 00:00:42,490
I signed a confidentiality agreement with the government

20
00:00:42,490 --> 00:00:43,570
I really can't say

21
00:00:43,570 --> 00:00:45,770
Just think that your son is doing something for the country
